  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "d4MLzHrLm9qDwzwslhjJ7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 417.7347868180823,
      "y": 113.08085515068046,
      "width": 1078.399024517515,
      "height": 2600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1895716983,
      "version": 1800,
      "versionNonce": 423318972,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1743181161514,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Quick delivery apps - zepto, blinkit\n\nFunctional requirements:\n\n1. Fast delivery of different products\n2. Warehouse management\n3. Product searching/ordering of a product\n4. Delivery tracking\n\nOut of scope:\n1. Delivery agent onboarding\n2. User management\n3. Payments\n4. Notifications\n\nScale:\n\n1. Users: 100M DAU\n2. 10M products\n3. Centres: 10K per city\n4. Orders: 10K per hour/city ~ 10K * 24 ~ 240k ~ 1M orders per day\n\nNon functional requirements:\n1. Scalability: orders\n2. Low latency: Especially for search. (< 500ms)\n3. Highly available\n4. Availability >> consistency -> Eventual consistency\n\nBack of the envelope calculation:\n\n1. Read\n    100M * 10 ~ 1000M / 10^5 ~ 10k TPS\n2. Write\n\n\nCore entities:\n\n0. DeliveryPartner\nid\nlocation: Location()\n\n1. Order\norderId: UUID\nuserId: UUID, FK\nDeliveryPartner\n\n2. Product\nproductId: UUID\nprice\nbrand\n\n3. Inventory\ninventoryId\nproductId: FK, Product\ncreatedAt\nupdatedAt\n\n4. Warehouse\nwarehouseId\nList[Products]\nlocation\n\n5. OrderProduct\nproductId\nwarehouseId: FK, Warehouse\nquantity\nprice\n\nAPIs:\n\n1. GET /api/v1/products?filters={ location, keywords }&page=1&limit=20&sortBy=relevance\n\n{\n    \"products\": [\n    {\n\n    }\n    ]\n}\n\n2. POST /api/v1/order\nrequest headers -> JWT token -> userId\n{\n    \"productId\": \"\",\n    \"quantity\": 5,\n    \"totalAmountPaid\": 1200\n}\n\n3. GET /api/v1/order/{orderId}/status\n\n{\n    \"location\": \"\",\n    \"deliveryPartner\": {\n        \"name\": \"\",\n        \"phone\": \"\"\n    }\n}\n\nWarehouse:\n4. POST /api/v1/product\n5. POST /api/v1/inventory\n6. GET /api/v1/inventory/{inventoryId}\n7. GET /api/v1/inventory/{inventoryId}\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Quick delivery apps - zepto, blinkit\n\nFunctional requirements:\n\n1. Fast delivery of different products\n2. Warehouse management\n3. Product searching/ordering of a product\n4. Delivery tracking\n\nOut of scope:\n1. Delivery agent onboarding\n2. User management\n3. Payments\n4. Notifications\n\nScale:\n\n1. Users: 100M DAU\n2. 10M products\n3. Centres: 10K per city\n4. Orders: 10K per hour/city ~ 10K * 24 ~ 240k ~ 1M orders per day\n\nNon functional requirements:\n1. Scalability: orders\n2. Low latency: Especially for search. (< 500ms)\n3. Highly available\n4. Availability >> consistency -> Eventual consistency\n\nBack of the envelope calculation:\n\n1. Read\n    100M * 10 ~ 1000M / 10^5 ~ 10k TPS\n2. Write\n\n\nCore entities:\n\n0. DeliveryPartner\nid\nlocation: Location()\n\n1. Order\norderId: UUID\nuserId: UUID, FK\nDeliveryPartner\n\n2. Product\nproductId: UUID\nprice\nbrand\n\n3. Inventory\ninventoryId\nproductId: FK, Product\ncreatedAt\nupdatedAt\n\n4. Warehouse\nwarehouseId\nList[Products]\nlocation\n\n5. OrderProduct\nproductId\nwarehouseId: FK, Warehouse\nquantity\nprice\n\nAPIs:\n\n1. GET /api/v1/products?filters={ location, keywords }&page=1&limit=20&sortBy=relevance\n\n{\n    \"products\": [\n    {\n\n    }\n    ]\n}\n\n2. POST /api/v1/order\nrequest headers -> JWT token -> userId\n{\n    \"productId\": \"\",\n    \"quantity\": 5,\n    \"totalAmountPaid\": 1200\n}\n\n3. GET /api/v1/order/{orderId}/status\n\n{\n    \"location\": \"\",\n    \"deliveryPartner\": {\n        \"name\": \"\",\n        \"phone\": \"\"\n    }\n}\n\nWarehouse:\n4. POST /api/v1/product\n5. POST /api/v1/inventory\n6. GET /api/v1/inventory/{inventoryId}\n7. GET /api/v1/inventory/{inventoryId}\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
